      "extract": "\\label{sec31} To calculate the spectral correlations, we insert the polynomials $p_n^{(N_f)}(x,M)$ in Eq.~(\\ref{kernel}) for the kernel $K_N^{(N_f)}(x,y,M)$. The microscopic limit is obtained according to Eq.~(\\ref{eq1.1}) by rescaling energies and quark masses by $2N\\Sigma$. We define $\\lambda=2N\\Sigma \\sqrt{x}$ and $m_f=2N\\Sigma M_f$. In the limit $N\\to\\infty$, we want both $\\lambda$ and $m_f$ to be of order",
