      "extract": "\\label{sec4} We have computed the microscopic spectrum of the massive QCD Dirac operator, including the microscopic spectral density and the distribution of the smallest eigenvalue, for an arbitrary number of flavors, arbitrary quark masses, and arbitrary topological charge. Our results generalize the previously known results for the microscopic correlations in the chiral limit \\cite{Verb93}. The distribution of the",
